```{=html}
<ul class="entries">
<% for (const it of items) { %><li><span class="t"><a href="<%= it.url %>"><%= it.title %></a></span><br><span class="m"><%= it.event %><% if (it.location) { %>, <%= it.location %><% } %>, <%= it.date %><% if (it.slides) { %>, <a href="<%= it.slides %>">slides</a><% } %></span></li>
<% } %></ul>
```
